{"id":"commune","lemma":"commune","pos":"noun","rank":3680,"glosses":["commune (administrative subdivision)","commune (community living together with common property)"],"ipa":"/kɔ.myn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9e/Fr-commune.ogg/Fr-commune.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"communes"},"formAudio":{"communes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-communes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je veux vivre dans une commune.","en":"I want to live in a town.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"C'est une erreur commune.","en":"It's a common mistake.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"error"},null]},{"text":"Je vis dans une petite commune.","en":"I'm living in a small town.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"small, little","l":"petit"},null]},{"text":"La musique est une langue commune pour l'humanité.","en":"Music is the universal language.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/26212","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"music"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tongue"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"humanity"}]},{"text":"Il s'agissait d'une décision commune.","en":"It was a joint decision.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to act, to do","l":"agir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"decision"},null]}]}